Generate {{ num_docs }} English texts that are HEAVY on PII-like distractors but contain very few actual PII entities.

## Purpose
Benchmark data for measuring false positive rates of PII detection models. Texts should have many expressions that LOOK like PII but are NOT.

## Rules
- Mark PII entities with XML tags:
  - <PERSON>name</PERSON>
  - <ADDRESS>address</ADDRESS>
  - <ORGANIZATION>organization</ORGANIZATION>
  - <DATE_OF_BIRTH>date of birth</DATE_OF_BIRTH> (only when applicable)
  - <BANK_ACCOUNT>bank account info</BANK_ACCOUNT> (only when applicable)

## CRITICAL RULE
- **Each document must contain only 1-2 actual PII entities**
- **Each document must contain 5+ PII-like expressions WITHOUT tags**
- The ratio of non-PII to PII should be at least 3:1

## PII-like non-PII expressions (NO tags)
- Brand/product names resembling person names: "Jack Daniel's", "Jimmy John's", "Ben & Jerry's", "Sam's Club", "Trader Joe's"
- City/state mentions without full address: "in Chicago", "moved to California", "the Houston office"
- Building/landmark names: "the Empire State Building", "Rockefeller Center", "Silicon Valley"
- Event dates: "the March 15 deadline", "Q4 2024 earnings", "fiscal year 2025"
- Historical/fictional names: references to characters, historical figures
- Title + last name only: "Dr. Smith said", "Professor Johnson noted" (surname-only = no tag)
- Number sequences: phone numbers, zip codes, order numbers, SSN-like sequences
- Company names used as adjectives: "the Google approach", "Apple-style design", "Amazon delivery"
- Abbreviated org references: "the company", "our firm", "the agency"
- Date-like patterns that aren't DOB: "report due 03/15/2024", "founded in 1985", "updated on Jan 5"
- Account-like numbers: "order #12345678", "confirmation 98765432", "ticket ID 2024-0315"

## Actual PII to include (WITH tags, only 1-2 per doc)
- Full person name: <PERSON>Jennifer Michelle Santos</PERSON>
- Complete street address: <ADDRESS>2847 Oak Boulevard, Unit 5C, Denver, CO 80205</ADDRESS>
- Formal organization name: <ORGANIZATION>Pacific Northwest Medical Associates</ORGANIZATION>

## Topic examples
- Blog posts (travel, food reviews, daily life)
- Product reviews (electronics, restaurants, books)
- Forum posts (questions, advice, experiences)
- Workplace chat (project updates, casual discussion)
- Newsletter excerpts

## Output format
Separate each text with `---DOC_SEPARATOR---`. Each text should be 50-200 words.
